{
  "id": "1SA.14",
  "number": "14",
  "bookId": "1SA",
  "reference": "1 Samwil 14",
  "verseCount": 52,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "14",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1SA 14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "14",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie etimbre i ceng’ acel, nia Yonathan ma wod Saul uwacu ni jalawobi ma yeyo ban pare kumae, Bin, dong’ wacidh lokaca ba ot ma tek mi Jufilisti, ma ni yo lokaca. Ento eyero ngo ni won. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul ubedo i kajik mi Gibeya the yendulemo ma ni i Migron: man dhanu ma gini karacelo kude giyenyo romo dhanu dak abusiel; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "man Ahiya, ma wod Ahitub, m’umin Ikabod ma wod Finehaz, ma wod Eli, ma jalam pa Yehova i Cilo, m’ukendo ugoke. E dhanu ging’eyo ngo nia Yonathan ucidho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man i kind kakadhu, ma Yonathan uyenyo ekadh ecidh ko kum ot ma tek mi Jufilisti, leb cana nuti i ng’ete acel, man leb cana ni i ng’ete mucelo: man nying’ acel en e Bozez, man nying’ mucelo Sene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Leb cana acel utingre yor ariwa ma malu i wang’ Mikmac, man mucelo ke yor ariwa ma piny i wang’ Geba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan uwacu ni jalawobi ma yeyo jambali pare kumae, Bin, man wek waci lokaca ba ot ma tek mi ju ma jutimo yaa ngo i kumgi: kuno nyo Yehova bitimo iwa; kum gin moko mbe ma cero Yehova kubodho ku dhanu dupa kadi ku ma nok. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jayei jambali pare wacu ire kumae, Tim gin ceke ma ni i adundeni: lokri, nen, wanuti wakudi calkud adundeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathan ulund uwacu kumae, Nen, wabikadhu lokaca ba dhanune, man wabiwodhra giwa i wang’gi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tek giwacu kumeni i bang’wa, Wubed maram wabibino ko i beng’wu; wabilund cungo ling’ i kakawa, e wabiidho malu i bang’gi ngo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento tek giwacu kumae, Wuidh malu i bang’wa; wabilund idho malu; kum Yehova miogi i cingwa: man maeni bibedo giranyutha iwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E gin ario ginyuthri gigi ni ju m’i ot ma tek mi Jufilisti: e Jufilisti giwacu kumae, Nen, Juebrania giwok woko kud i vur ma gipondo i ie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu m’i ot ma tek giloko lembe ni Yonathan ku jayei jambali pare, man giwacu kumae, Wuidh malu i bang’wa, man wabinyutho iwu lembe moko. Man Yonathan uwacu ni jayei jambali pare, Idh malu i toka; kum Yehova miogi i cing’ Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Yonathan umulo amula ku cinge ku tiende de, man jayei jamb ali pare yor i ng’eye: e gipodho i wang’ Yonathan; man jayei jambali pare negogi yor i ng’eye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man nek maeno ma kwong’a, ma Yonathan ku jayei jambali pare gitimo, yenyo romo dhanu pier ario, i ng’et lela ma romo ruvangu dak abic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man mielkum ni i kagonjo, i thim, man i kind dhanu ceke; ju m’i ot ma tek, man junyothng’om bende, kumgi miel; ng’om de yengre: kum kumeno mielkum nuti dit apila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man jukur pa Saul ma gini i Gibeya pa Benyamin gineno; man, nen, udul dhanu lui woko, e gicidho kun ku kun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saul ulund uwacu ni dhanu ma gini karacelo kude kumae, Kawono wukwan, man wunen ng’a m’uai i bang’wa. Man ka gikwanu, Nen, Yonathan ku jayei jambali pare gimbe keca. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul uwacu ni Ahiya kumae, Kel sanduk pa Mungu keni. Kum sanduk pa Mungu ni keca nindo maeca karacelo ku nyithindho mir Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man etimbre, kinde ma Saul ubeweco ba jalam, nia yakni ma ni ka ma Jufilisti gonjo i ie bedo asu man ebedhetho adhetha: man Saul uwacu ni i jalam kumae, Kab cingi cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man Saul ku dhanu ceke ma ni karacelo kude ucokri karacelo, man gibino ba lwiny: man, nen, palamularu mi dhanu ceke kubang’gi kubang’gi pa ng’atuman ni kum wadi, man ang’abacwiny nuti dit apila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nie Juebrania ma nwang’u gini karacelo ku Jufilisti calu ma naka, man m’uidho malu karacelo kugi i kagonjo, kud i ng’om mi ng’ete gbur, gin bende gilokri kara gibed ku Juisraeli ma gini karacelo ku Saul ku Yonathan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumeno dhanu ceke mir Israel ma gipondo i ng’om gudi pa Efraim, kinde ma giwinjo nia Jufilisti ringo, gin bende gilubo tokgi ma tek i lwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kum kumeno Yehova bodho Israel i ceng’ maeca: man lwiny ukadhu ba Beth-aven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "E dhanu mir Israel cwinygi dieng’ ceng’ maeca; kum Saul ukwong’o dhanu, ewacu kumae, Kwong’ ubed wi ng’atu m’ucamu cemo moko maram uthieno wok ko, man aculo kwor wi judegina. Kum kumeno dhanu moko mbe m’ubilo cemo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man dhanu ceke gibino i luli; man kic ni keca i ng’om. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man kinde ma dhanu wok ba luli, nen, pedekic upodho: ento ng’atu moko mbe m’uketho cinge kum dhoge; kum dhanu gilworo kwonge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento Yonathan uwinjo ngo ka won ung’olo ni dhanu ku kwong’: kum kumeno etieyo dhu uluth ma ni i cinge, man egwelo kudo mio kicne, e eketho cinge i dhoge; man wang’e lero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng’atu acel m’i Idnd dhanu ulund uloko lembe, man ewacu kumae, Wuru ng’olo ni dhanu ngili ngili ku kwong’, ewacu kumae, Kwong’ ubed wi ng’atu m’ucamu cemo i ceng’ maeni. E dhanu givoc. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yonathan ulund uwacu kumae, Vwa ng’abu cwiny ng’om: nen, akwayuwu, maram wang’a lero ko, kum abilo nyathi kic maeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.14.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 14:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Esagu dit ungo, tek dhanu gicamu giyeng’ tin kum ayeki mi judegi migi ma ginwang’u? kum kawono nek ma dit umbe i kind Jufilisti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.14.30",
